Subject: [PATCH 020/107] linux-postmarketos-rockchip: add rk3588-uconsole
 support

Adds `ocp8178` and `cwu50` drivers to kernel to support uConsole
clockworkPi w/ Radxa CM5. In addition, adds device tree for device.

Part-of: <https://gitlab.nura.eco/nura/pmaports/-/merge_requests/8285>
